      "genre": "记叙文",
      "title": "Who Invented Basketball?",
      "body": "Basketball is loved by millions of people, but do you know who invented it? It was invented in 1891 by a Canadian teacher named James Naismith. At that time, he worked at a school in the US. The winter was cold, and students could not play outside. Naismith wanted a new indoor game. He divided the students into two teams and used a basket on the wall. The first game was played with a soccer ball. Soon the game became popular. Today, basketball is played all over the world, and Naismith is looked up to as a hero.",
