      "genre": "说明文",
      "title": "The Story of Tea",
      "body": "Tea is one of the most popular drinks in the world. It is said that tea was discovered by accident. A long time ago, a Chinese ruler named Shen Nong was boiling water under a tree. Suddenly, some leaves fell into the water. The water changed color and gave off a nice smell. Shen Nong tasted it and found it delicious. This was how tea was first made. Later, tea was brought to Korea and Japan. By the 17th century, it was also traded to Western countries. Today, tea is drunk by people everywhere, but it all began with a happy accident.",
