      "genre": "议论文",
      "title": "Inventions Change Our Lives",
      "body": "Inventions have changed our daily lives in many ways. Think about the light bulb. Before it was invented, people used candles at night. Now our homes are filled with light. The telephone was invented so that people could talk over long distances. Today, mobile phones are used by almost everyone. Even small things, like the zipper, make life easier. It was invented in 1893 and is now used on clothes and bags everywhere. Some inventions were made on purpose, and some were made by accident. But all of them share one thing: they were created to solve problems and make our lives better.",
