      "genre": "记叙文",
      "title": "My Science Project",
      "body": "Last month, our class had a science project about inventions. Each student was asked to make something useful. My friend Tom made a small lamp. It was powered by the sun, so no electricity was needed. A girl named Lily made a bag that was made from old clothes. My project was a clock that was made of used wood. The teacher asked us how our things were produced. We explained that everything was made by hand from waste materials. The teacher was very pleased. She said that good inventions are not always made of expensive things. Sometimes the best ideas come from simple materials.",
